/@fukuramochi/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/efe9822f/uploads/origins/8edf914d-b86f-4626-821c-f3b2ab7e4ff9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e6a396fe3e6a386d2a8cd31dd947d95", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/efe9822f/uploads/origins/8edf914d-b86f-4626-821c-f3b2ab7e4ff9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e6a396fe3e6a386d2a8cd31dd947d95, https://si.imgix.net/efe9822f/uploads/origins/8edf914d-b86f-4626-821c-f3b2ab7e4ff9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fab6aaa0dbe4cffe7174696a753919e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/efe9822f/uploads/origins/8edf914d-b86f-4626-821c-f3b2ab7e4ff9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdba3dccdef715122693b1a09960e2d0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールをありがとう、\n\n私の友人のキャラクター、かがりをあなたのかわいいスタイルで描いていただけませんか？\nお好きなように描いてください！\n\nお忙しい中、ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/MRBWdg0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fukuramochi/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32477dd4/uploads/origins/ab114aca-bbb5-4ac2-8fe3-73aa461850b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4b2b08d61d099f254da8a043fffaa9b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/32477dd4/uploads/origins/ab114aca-bbb5-4ac2-8fe3-73aa461850b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4b2b08d61d099f254da8a043fffaa9b, https://si.imgix.net/32477dd4/uploads/origins/ab114aca-bbb5-4ac2-8fe3-73aa461850b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48e17207ee28009c6bd25f7ef2a1bed3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/32477dd4/uploads/origins/ab114aca-bbb5-4ac2-8fe3-73aa461850b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d03ae9ec16cbdd410daef76f05f6866f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "📛ふくらもち📛様\n\n始めまして。個人vtuberの櫻井なちこと申します。\nご丁寧なアピールありがとうございま